OL,3,GNEWSA'I was heading for a breakdown,
OL,4,Athen books saved my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FInternational bestselling author Kit de
OL,7,FWaal has told the BBC how a chance
OL,8,Fconversation changed her life after she
OL,9,Fleft home at 16, struggled with drugs
OL,10,Fand found herself on the brink of a
OL,11,Fserious mental breakdown.
OL,13,FThe Birmingham-born writer said she was
OL,14,F"a couple of months away from a very
OL,15,Fserious breakdown" before a solicitor's
OL,16,Freading recommendation changed the
OL,17,Fcourse of her life.
OL,19,FSpeaking to BBC Upload, she said: "I
OL,20,Ffound the world of reading, the world
OL,21,Fof imagination.
